# ::tok If the interest rate increases by half a percent, how much will the monthly payment on the mortgage be expensive?
# ::node	i2	interest	2-3
# ::node	r	rate	3-4
# ::node	i	increase-01	4-5
# ::node	h	half	6-7
# ::node	a	amr-unknown	9-10
