        :ARG0-of (m / make-up-07
            :ARG1 (m2 / mortgage-01))
        :mod (o2 / other)))

# ::tok If the interest rate does indeed rise by half a percent, the increase will amount, according to Tsror's estimate, to about NIS 620 in a mortgage of about NIS 1.2 million.
# ::node	i4	interest	2-3
